{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/584366-relics-as-characters","id":584366,"title":"Relics as Characters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-09T00:58:53-07:00","id":584366,"title":"Relics as Characters","content":"Relics are magic items powered by the energy of life itself, life energy tinged with every conceivable human emotion, some of them absorbing this life energy, this emotion, for up to 6000 years.<br /> <br /> So has anyone added relics that have gained will and intelligence as emergent properties to their mummy game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T02:19:35-07:00","id":584402,"title":"","content":"Hm. In my current games, I have a hunk of metal (Regia) containing the souls of everyone who has died in its vicinity, a heart (Uter) that can be implanted into a mortal's chest to raise them from the dead as an unaging immortal, but influenced by the emotions of the heart's original owner, and a Seba which creates scarab-like monsters ostensibly to perform a wish of the bearer's, but who secretly desire to expand their race independent of the relic through creating a Queen. The first and last have been touched upon in my Actual Plays, I don't think anyone's encountered the heart yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar"